              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "नायक — nāyak — \"a protagonist; the hero of a story\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "चित्रपटाचा नायक एक साधा शिक्षक आहे. citrapaṭācā nāyak ek sādhā śikṣak āhe. The hero of the film is an ordinary teacher."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A heroine is नायिका."
            }
          ]
        },
