          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "नायक (nāyak) is a tatsama, taken from Sanskrit nāyaka, 'a guide, a leader; the hero of a drama' (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
